/-
Superfusion / RMod / Constructive / ConnectorTableData

Choice-free coefficient data for all 512 real-gauge connectors, selectively
ported from the existing saved-branch `Constructive/ConnectorTable.lean`.
The original Lean source is not modified.

The table at index `(a * 8 + b) * 8 + c` is the row-major coefficient array
of `T(a,b,c)` in the transported Lean frames.  `inverseNumeratorCoeffNat` is
its computable conjugate transpose.  The positive integer `inverseScaleNat`
satisfies `T * U = lambda I` and `U * T = lambda I`; hence `U / lambda` is the
actual inverse.  No inverse or witness is selected here.
-/
